            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Yehu garmoó Hanani gari axaás, daanduú Ba'ashawo, iwa kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuúng Ba'asha, aníng una uráy haniís, uri waawutmoó muk'eé' oo Israelír wa qaás. Ala kuúng Yeroboamu una aleealús, muk'eé' oo Israeli kway baraá tlakweemí dahás, nee aníng iri buhhtisiyé' ar tlakweemaaín kudá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aaweek, aníng kuúng nee múk do'oge nu hhaamiís, do'ók u adór doó Yeroboamu laáq, garmoó Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dír do'oge heéqo gwaa'a baraá gixsa ku /aay nee seeaawe nee oo qo gwaa'a baraá qaymo ku /aay nee tsir/o.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa Ba'asha aa tleéhh nee migtose sleémeero kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'i oo waawituú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Ba'asha iri gwaá' kuri foól baraá Tirsa, garmaawós Ela iri waawuti'iín kitaangose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ daanduú Ba'asha nee do'ose Yehu gari axaás, garmoó Hanani, asma tlehhma'aá tlakw kudaá Ba'asha aa tleéhh geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, guri mune duúx ar tlehhmi'iiwós kudá' aa tleéhh, asma inós Yeroboamu guna aleealuús, nee doó Yeroboamu guri qwaareés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri tsár nee lahhoó' oo waawuti'iimár Asa waawutmoó múk Yuda, Ela garmoó Ba'asha waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún ar múk Israeli baraá Tirsár wa ale, kureeri ngaa /aáy tsár baraá waawuti'iimaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagadiyusmoowós Simri kuduú gaarduuwós kudaá uruuxuung guri geewaqaát. Looarká wake waawutmo Ela iwa Tirsa i dirii'i, dír doó Arsa kudaádá' doó waawutmoó ga/áw, Ela ina xufiít iri ooniít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Simri iri dáh baraá do', guri gaás. Iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa aleeró. Kurkwí oo mibeeri tsár nee faanqw oo Asa tawa waawutmoó múk Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Simri waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún, múk doó Ba'asha sleémeero guri tsuú/, tam panmo gwaa geexayká oo doó Ba'asha laqaá tumu mulqumowós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa oó' ar loohír aarusmo Yehu daanduú Ba'ashawo iri bó/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí sleémeero ina tleehharuút as tlakweemadá' Ba'asha nee garmaawós Ela na tleehhiyé'. Inooín AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli nguna buhhtisiyé', as inooín tlakweema ngiwa tleehhiyé'. Múk Israeli nguri dahaasiyé' baraá tlakweemií alé ar slaqsi'ii'ín kudá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa Ela aa tleéhh sleémeero kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'i oo waawituú múk Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simri deelo ngaa hhe'eés faanqw amoodár Tirsár wá ale. Qoomaarihe Asa waawutmoó yaamaá Yuda kureeri ngaa /aáy baraá waawuti'iimaro a mibeeri tsár nee faanqw. Naagáy múk Israeli qoomaarihe ta burumburiít baraá gixsár Gibetoni ar Filisti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee slaqwaruusér Israeli ngiwa axaasiyé' adór Simri waawutmo ngura geewaqaát gway gaás, sleémeero Omri heeín kudá' úr baraá slaqwaraaro nguri waawutmooín wa qaasiyé' baldár kilae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omri nee slaqwaruuserós tari tláy Gibetoni, gixsár Tirsa kari harweér. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simri adoorí ngiwa ár adór gixsa kara harweér, iri dáh baraá doó waawutmo, do' guri asltí qaás, inós iri baraadí gwaá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí ina tleehharút asma tlakweemadá' aa tleéhh geeraá AAKOÓ Munguhe, inós Yeroboamu guna aleealuús, nee múk Israeli guri baraá tlakweemáy dahaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa Simri nee geewaqatudá' aa tleehhi kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'i oo waawituú Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli iri qasiít baraá daqooráy tsár, tlaqtá wák Tibni garmoó Ginat, guna eehát guri waawutmooín wa qás, nee tlaqtá tsár Omri guri eehát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo múk bartá Omri slaqwaraaro múk Tibni garmoó Ginat guna arbaá/, Tibni iri gwaá' nee Omri kuri waawutmoó wa qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omri waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún a kurkú mibeeraá tám nee wak awa waawuti'iimár Asa waawutmoó múk Yuda. Inós kureeri ngaa /aáy baraá waawuti'iimaro a mibaá nee tsár kureeraá lahhoó' awa waawuti'iimaro, amór gixsár Tirsa gana hoót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tloomár Samaria gari tlaáxw ar peésár kume lahhoó' dír heé ta bay Shemerí wa ale, koo/ír gawit gari tleéhh nee gixsa gari gawaadí tleéhh. Gixsadá' gari báy Samaria, as umuú heedá' ta bay Shemeri, kudá' ngiwa tlaáxw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omri tlehhma'aá tlakw gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, tlehhma'aá tlakw gina tleéhh waawituú hatlá' sleémeero kudá' aa giirin ba/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós Yeroboamu garmoó Nebati guna aleealuús, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli, guri buhhtís, nee múk Israeli guri baraá tlakweemií dahaás as munguidaá hatlá' ngiwa sluufmisiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa Omri aa tleéhh, nee migtose sleémeero kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'i oo waawituú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Omri iri gwaá', kuri foól baraá Samaria, garmaawós Ahabu iri waawuti'iín kitaangós wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri tám nee dakaát oo waawuti'iimár Asawo waawutmoó Yuda, Ahabu garmoó Omri, waawuti'iimár múk Israeli gana iimu/ún. Ina yaamaá Samariár wa waawuti'ín kureeri mibeeri tsár nee tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu garmoó Omri tlehhma'aá tlakw gina tleéhh geeraá AAKOÓ Munguhe ta waawitá sleémeero kudá' aa giirini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám tam tlehhma'aá Yeroboamu garmoó Nebati gaa eehari, Ahabu Yesebeli gari duúx, dasír Etba'ali, waawutmoó Sidoni. Ahabu Ba'ali guri sagadiyuús, nee gway sluufmiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba'ali guri dó' i tleéhh baraá gixsár Samaria, nee baraá guruuwo kitángw i ilahhooárií hanmiisi guri tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú /ameeni kudá' ta bay Ashera guna tleéhh. Ahabu tlehhma'aá tlakw awa yaariir gina tleéhh, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli guri buhhtís waawituú hatlá' sleémeero aa girin ba/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár waawuti'iimarose Hieli kuduú Beteli gixsár Yeriko gana /abeés tleehharo. Qoomár iwa iihhafiirír qamin ar gixsár Yeriko, Abiramu garmaawós oo baris ina gwaá'. Qoomár iwa afér gixsár tlehhiiti Segubu garmaawós kudá' niiná iri malé gwaá'. Adoorí ina tleehharút ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó' ar afkú Yoshua, garmoó Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
